## Testing Plan

1. Make all code changes
2. Update env vars locally and on Vercel
3. Create a new test draft in Sanity using `node scripts/tests/create-test-post.mjs`
4. Publish from Sanity Studio with "Send Subscriber Notification" ON
5. Wait for next cron-job.org cycle (15 min)
6. Check Gmail inbox — verify it lands in **Primary** or **Updates** tab instead of Promotions

---

## Expected Outcome

These changes combined should move the email from Promotions to either **Primary** or **Updates** tab. The email will still look professional (logo + cover image + CTA button) but will have a much lighter footprint that Gmail's AI treats as informational rather than promotional.
